areast-font-family: 굴림체;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; 라</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. 2021.12.21.(화) 12시이</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">후에 선발 확정 예정</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.2;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; * </span>코로나19로 인한 행정권고 등으로 기관이 폐쇄된 경우 근로활동이 중지될 수 있음</p><p style=\"line-height: 1.2;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; * </span>기관 사정으로 인해&nbsp;근로 가능한&nbsp;기관 명단이&nbsp;변경 될 수 있음</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">2. </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">신청 장소</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">한국장학재단</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">-</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">장학금</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">-</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">국가근로장학금</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">-</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">근로장학관리</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">-</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">희망근로지신청</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">3. </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">신청 방법</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">붙임 매뉴얼 참조</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; * </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\"></span>신청한 희망근로지 순위대로 사전선정 실시 예정(최대 5개씩 선택가능)&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">4. </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">안내사항</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; 가</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">신청 학생이 기관과 매칭될 경우 예산 범위내에서 최대한 선발 예정</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; 나</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">학기당 최대 52</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">0</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">시간 이내로 근로 가능</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; 다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">집중근로 운영기간</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">근로기간</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">) : 2021.1.3.(</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">월</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">)~2022.2.18.(</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">금</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ※ </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">희망근로지 선정 및 입력후</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><strong><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255); font-family: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">신청하기 버튼을 </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\"><font color=\"#333333\"><span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">꼭 </span></font></span><span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">눌러주세요</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></strong></strong></p><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\"><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0p